! Polar AlAs on its irreducible wedge: `alas-raman-wedge.in` with As moved from
! a(1/4,1/4,1/4) to a(1/4,1/4,0.29), point group mm2, polar along z, the cell
! notes/incompat/I90.md measured the proper piezoelectric tensor on. The
! unshifted 4x4x4 grid reduces to 18 points. On a polar crystal the wedge
! residue of a diagonal strain survives the rank-3 average, so this is the cell
! that says the norm-conserving wedge completion is in (I90 fix round).
 &control
    calculation = 'scf'
    prefix = 'alas'
 /
 &system
    ibrav = 2, celldm(1) = 10.575, nat = 2, ntyp = 2,
    ecutwfc = 10.0
 /
 &electrons
    conv_thr = 1.0d-12
    mixing_beta = 0.7
 /
ATOMIC_SPECIES
 Al  26.98  Al.pz-vbc.UPF
 As  74.92  As.pz-bhs.UPF
ATOMIC_POSITIONS (alat)
 Al 0.00 0.00 0.00
 As 0.25 0.25 0.2900
K_POINTS (automatic)
 4 4 4 0 0 0
